  "action": "settle",
  "subject": "HN casings – confirmation of agreed renewal",
  "body": "Dear Mr Brandlhuber,\n\nThank you for your confirmation and constructive cooperation. We accept your offer at €131.25 per unit, effective 1 January 2027, with payment 14 days net.\n\nThe agreed fixed terms remain: 8,150 units annually, a 12-month contract, 42-day lead time, FCA delivery, no index clause and no tooling charge.\n\nPlease ensure the delivery schedule totals the agreed annual quantity, as confirmed in your earlier reply. We will proceed with the order on this basis.\n\nWe look forward to continuing our partnership.\n\nKind regards,\nHollerau Pumpenwerke, Purchasing",
  "term_sheets": [
    {
      "unit_price": 131.25,
      "effective_date": "2027-01-01",
      "payment_days": 14
